From ca766cd7a42c4a18644a0e7ae7e60ac78a47e370 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LU-003 <293645289+LU-003@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 16:06:25 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ip12): deliver image task products

Pure image task results were classified but dropped because delivery only emitted video URLs and always sent an empty images list. Persist and stream image products, recover legacy missing cards from task state, and prevent follow-up claims when no product was extracted.
